\loch\af2\dbch\af2\hich\f2\strike0\ulnone\cf2 Our initial analysis concerns the direct effect of the assigned treatments across all subjects. The Delegitimization Index dependent variable ranges in value from 1\u8211 4, with 4 representing the highest degree of perception that the 2020 election lacks legitimacy. As seen in the mean differences reported in the first column of Table 2, exposure to all three treatment groups increases Index scores (signifying an increased perception that the election was not legitimate). Treatment Group 1 (no-SoS message) and Group 3 (high transparency) are statistically higher versus the control group (with both treatment effects essentially the same). This finding provides overall support for H1 with exposure to voting dead materials increasing skepticism towards the election irrespective of subsequent interventions by election officials.Table 2.Treatment Effects On Delegitimization Index by Party ID.}
